    "text": "Let $x_{n}=\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^{2}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{6}\\right)^{2}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{10}\\right)^{2} \\ldots$ $\\left(1-\\frac{1}{\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}}\\right)^{2}, n \\geq 2$ Then, the value of $\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty} x_{n}$ is",
